      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DISSALTO (7) is a former Victorian who had his first Tassie start on the synthetic at Devonport and ran very well, finishing third. Better for it and has two wins on the turf. Tricky gate but expected to go close again. ALFARINO (1) returned from a long break in maiden class at Hobart and after getting back wound up strongly to score. Fitter and can go on with it. OUR PEPMENARTIE (4) was well off best on the synthetic last time. Ran very well the start prior on the turf at Hobart and back to that surface today is well worth another chance. GEEGEES ACE (3) wound up strongly at Hobart last time and has since trialled well. Turf winner who will be hard to hold out. MISS LYRA (5) gave a sight from the wide gate last time and can go close again.",
